OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers to strike after       
OL,4,Arejecting pay offer                    
OL,6,FAbout 1,300 bus drivers in Sussex are  
OL,7,Fset to strike in a dispute over pay,   
OL,8,Fthe union Unite says.                  
OL,10,FMembers of the union employed by Sussex
OL,11,FGo-Ahead will walk out on 1, 10 and 19 
OL,12,FDecember after rejecting a two-year pay
OL,13,Foffer with Unite saying this will cause
OL,14,F"major bus service disruption".        
OL,16,FThe industrial action is expected to   
OL,17,Faffect Brighton & Hove Buses, Crawley  
OL,18,FMetrobus and Spirit of Sussex services 
OL,19,Fand the union warns industrial action  
OL,20,Fcould intensify if the dispute is not  
OL,21,Fresolved.                              
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
