OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers to strike after       
OL,4,Arejecting pay offer                    
OL,6,FMatthew Ashton, managing director for  
OL,7,Fthe Sussex bus operators which fall    
OL,8,Funder Go-Ahead, said the company had   
OL,9,Fasked to meet union representatives and
OL,10,Fit hoped a resolution could be found.  
